  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xrviz::InterludeInstructionsDisplay
  uiDocument: {fileID: 1567376382}
  instructionsText: 'You are about to start the Collision Identification task.


    You
    will be placed in several scenes. There will be a robot trajectory playing in
    each that collides with an object in the environment. After identifying where
    the collision occurs, press the menu button to spawn a red indicator sphere.
    Move the red sphere to cover the place in the scene where the collision occurs.


    Press
    ''B'' on the Right Hand Controller to advance to the first scene. Press ''B''
    again when finished with each scene to advance to the next.'
